<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Affin 6-mth net up three pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Affin 6-mth net up three pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     112.52    vs	109.56</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     21.0     vs	 21.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		 540.86    vs	359.11</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 173.14    vs	125.20</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  6.51    vs  less  4.89</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Affin Holdings Bhd. It is involved in financial services.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
